const navItems=[['command','Dashboard'],['scanner','Market Scanner'],['quotes','Live Quotes'],['strategies','Strategy'],['backtest','Paper Replay'],['risk','Risk Management'],['journal','Journal'],['connections','Connections'],['session','Daily session'],['signal','Signal Analysis'],['approval','Trade Approval'],['orders','Positions & Orders'],['alerts','Alerts'],['health','System Health']];
const state={screen:'command',auto:(()=>{try{return localStorage.getItem('breakout.autoMode')==='true'}catch(error){return false}})(),toast:''};
let scannerTimer=null;
let liveData={net_pnl:0,trades:0,wins:0,win_rate_pct:0,signals:[],trades_detail:[],readiness:null,session_config:{account_balance:500000,trading_capital:500000,risk_per_trade_pct:0.25,daily_loss_pct:1}};
const candidates=[['RELIANCE','Large cap','2,490.00','2,472.00','0.73%','2.1x','ABOVE','READY'],['SBIN','Banking','862.70','857.70','0.58%','2.0x','ABOVE','WATCH'],['HEROMOTOCO','Auto','4,782.00','4,767.20','0.31%','1.8x','ABOVE','WATCH'],['SUNPHARMA','Pharma','1,240.80','1,251.30','-0.84%','1.4x','BELOW','REJECT'],['LT','Capital goods','3,584.00','3,570.40','0.38%','1.6x','ABOVE','WATCH'],['MARUTI','Auto','13,049.00','13,012.00','0.28%','1.5x','ABOVE','REJECT']];
function formatIndiaTime(value){if(!value)return '—';const date=new Date(value);if(Number.isNaN(date.getTime()))return value;return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-IN',{timeZone:'Asia/Kolkata',day:'2-digit',month:'short',year:'numeric',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',second:'2-digit',hour12:false}).format(date)+' IST'}
function app(){const item=navItems.find(x=>x[0]===state.screen)||navItems[0];document.querySelector('#app').innerHTML=`<aside class="rail"><div class="brand"><mark>B</mark> Breakout OS</div><nav class="nav">${navItems.map(([id,label])=>`<button class="${id===state.screen?'active':''}" data-screen="${id}">${label}</button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="environment">${state.auto?'Auto execution enabled':'Paper environment'}</div></aside><main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div class="heading"><h1>${item[1]}</h1><p>${subtitle(item[0])}</p></div><div class="badges"><span class="pill amber">SQLite paper replay</span><div class="mode-control"><span class="mode-copy">${state.auto?'AUTO':'PAPER'}</span><label class="switch"><input id="auto-toggle" type="checkbox" ${state.auto?'checked':''}><span class="slider"></span></label></div></div></header><section class="content">${screen(item[0])}</section></main><div class="toast ${state.toast?'show':''}">${state.toast}</div>`;bind();}
function subtitle(s){return {session:'Configure today’s capital, risk and execution readiness',command:'Live account, risk and opportunity overview',scanner:'Rank candidates and explain rejections',quotes:'Live Groww quotes and candle progress',signal:'Inspect the chart and every rule behind a signal',approval:'Final confirmation for Assisted mode',orders:'Broker-synchronized execution control',strategies:'Versioned signal and exit rules',backtest:'Evaluate a strategy with realistic costs',risk:'Hard limits and emergency actions',connections:'Groww and Upstox authorization and telemetry',journal:'Review execution and behavior over time',alerts:'Prioritize conditions requiring action',health:'Operational status and immutable events'}[s]||''}
function metric(label,value,sub='',tone=''){return `<div class="card metric"><div class="label">${label}</div><div class="value ${tone}">${value}</div><div class="sub">${sub}</div></div>`}
function shellCards(){const pnl=Number(liveData.net_pnl||0);return `<div class="grid cols-4">${metric('Paper replay P&L',`${pnl>=0?'+':''}INR ${pnl.toLocaleString('en-IN')}`,`${liveData.trades||0} closed simulated trades`,pnl>=0?'positive':'negative')}${metric('Win rate',`${liveData.win_rate_pct||0}%`,`${liveData.wins||0} wins / ${liveData.losses||0} losses`)}${metric('Open positions','0','No live broker exposure')}${metric('Daily risk','INR 0','Historical SQLite replay','positive')}</div>`}
function chart(){return `<div class="chart-wrap"><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 600 210" preserveAspectRatio="none"><line class="gridline" x1="0" x2="600" y1="40" y2="40"/><line class="gridline" x1="0" x2="600" y1="105" y2="105"/><line class="gridline" x1="0" x2="600" y1="170" y2="170"/><polyline points="0,145 45,125 90,141 135,112 180,122 225,92 270,105 315,78 360,86 405,60 450,70 495,44 540,58 600,25"/><polyline class="secondary" points="0,154 75,150 150,145 225,140 300,133 375,125 450,116 525,106 600,98"/></svg></div>`}
function readinessPanel(){const r=liveData.readiness;if(!r)return `<div class="card"><h3>Release readiness</h3><p class="intro">Loading SQLite validation gate…</p></div>`;const labels={paper_sessions_20:'At least 20 paper sessions',out_of_sample_available:'Out-of-sample period available',cost_model_configured:'Brokerage and slippage configured',duplicate_orders_clear:'Duplicate order references clear',uncertain_orders_clear:'Uncertain orders clear',audit_present:'Audit trail present',oos_positive_after_costs:'OOS profitable after costs',groww_token_configured:'Groww token configured',static_ip_confirmed:'Static IP confirmed',broker_approved:'Broker approval recorded'};const rows=Object.entries(r.checks).map(([key,value])=>`<div class="rule"><span>${labels[key]||key}</span><span class="status ${value?'pass':'fail'}">${value?'PASS':'BLOCKED'}</span></div>`).join('');return `<div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="split"><div><h3>Release readiness</h3><p class="intro">Server-side gate from SQLite replay and broker controls</p></div><span class="status ${r.ready_for_live?'pass':'fail'}">${r.ready_for_live?'READY FOR LIVE':'NOT LIVE-READY'}</span></div><div class="rule-list">${rows}</div><p class="notice" style="margin-top:18px">${r.ready_for_assisted?'Assisted mode gate passed.':'Assisted mode remains blocked until the cost-adjusted OOS result is positive.'} ${r.ready_for_live?'Live broker execution is permitted by the configured gates.':'Live execution is disabled; continue paper validation and configure Groww/static-IP/broker approvals when available.'}</p></div>`}
function sessionConfigPanel(){const c=liveData.session_config||{};return `<div class="card setup-card" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="split"><div><div class="eyebrow">BEFORE MARKET OPEN</div><h3>Capital & risk cockpit</h3><p class="intro">Choose how much of your broker balance this strategy may use today. These limits are enforced by the SQLite backend.</p></div><span class="status pass">SERVER ENFORCED</span></div><div class="setup-presets"><span class="detail-label">Quick allocation</span><button class="btn preset" data-preset="25">25%</button><button class="btn preset" data-preset="50">50%</button><button class="btn preset" data-preset="75">75%</button><button class="btn preset" data-preset="100">100%</button></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="account-balance">Total Groww balance (INR)</label><input id="account-balance" type="number" min="1" step="1" value="${c.account_balance||500000}" /></div><div class="field"><label for="trading-capital">Today’s trading allocation (INR)</label><input id="trading-capital" type="number" min="1" step="1" value="${c.trading_capital||500000}" /></div><div class="field"><label for="risk-per-trade">Risk per trade (%)</label><input id="risk-per-trade" type="number" min="0.01" max="5" step="0.01" value="${c.risk_per_trade_pct??0.25}" /></div><div class="field"><label for="daily-loss">Maximum daily loss (%)</label><input id="daily-loss" type="number" min="0.01" max="20" step="0.01" value="${c.daily_loss_pct??1}" /></div></div><div class="allocation-meter"><div class="split"><span>Margin utilization</span><b id="utilization-label">—</b></div><div class="meter"><span id="utilization-bar"></span></div><div class="setup-summary"><div><span>Risk per trade</span><b id="risk-amount">—</b></div><div><span>Daily loss stop</span><b id="loss-amount">—</b></div><div><span>Unused balance</span><b id="unused-amount">—</b></div></div></div><p class="notice" style="margin-top:16px">Example: ₹50,000 balance with ₹30,000 allocation uses 60% margin allocation. At 0.25% risk, planned risk is ₹75 per trade; at 1%, the daily stop is ₹300.</p></div>`}
function screen(s){if(s==='session')return `<div class="card"><h2>Start trading session</h2><p class="intro">Validate broker authorization, market data and risk dependencies before enabling a mode.</p><div class="grid cols-2"><div class="card"><div class="split"><div><h3>Upstox</h3><p class="intro">Connected · token valid</p></div><span class="status pass">CONNECTED</span></div><button class="btn">Reconnect</button></div><div class="card"><div class="split"><div><h3>Groww</h3><p class="intro">Token is managed on the Connections page</p></div><span class="status review">CHECK CONNECTION</span></div><button class="btn primary" data-screen="connections">Open Connections</button></div></div>${sessionConfigPanel()}${readinessPanel()}<div class="split" style="margin-top:24px"><span class="notice">${state.auto?'Auto execution is selected. Eligible signals proceed after risk approval.':'Assisted/Paper execution keeps an explicit approval step.'}</span><button class="btn primary" data-action="enable-session">Save setup & enable ${state.auto?'auto':'paper'} session</button></div></div>`;
if(s==='command')return `${shellCards()}<div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="card"><h2>Live breakout scanner</h2><p class="intro">Top qualified candidates ranked by the active strategy</p>${candidateTable(4)}<button class="btn primary" data-screen="scanner">Open scanner</button></div><div class="card"><div class="split"><div><h2>Selected setup</h2><p class="intro">RELIANCE · Long · 5-minute</p></div><span class="status pass">READY</span></div>${chart()}<div class="split" style="margin-top:15px"><span class="positive">Risk approved · INR 1,240</span><button class="btn primary" data-screen="approval">${state.auto?'Auto execution active':'Approve signal'}</button></div></div></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><h2>Open positions</h2>${positionsTable()}</div>`;
if(s==='scanner')return `<div class="card"><div class="split"><div><h2>Live breakout scanner</h2><p class="intro">Qualified signals from the Nifty 200 universe</p></div><button class="btn">Refresh data</button></div><div class="form-grid" style="margin-bottom:20px"><div class="field"><label>Universe</label><select><option>Nifty 200</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Direction</label><select><option>Long + Short</option></select></div></div>${candidateTable(6)}</div>`;
if(s==='signal')return `<div class="grid cols-2"><div class="card"><h2>RELIANCE signal analysis</h2><p class="intro">Long breakout · 5-minute completed candle</p>${chart()}<div class="grid cols-4" style="gap:10px;margin-top:18px">${metric('Entry','2,491.00','09:45')}${metric('Stop','2,472.50','0.74%')}${metric('Target','2,528.00','2.0R')}${metric('Risk','INR 1,240','approved')}</div></div><div class="card"><h2>Decision checklist</h2><p class="intro">Every condition must pass</p><div class="rule-list">${['Opening range break','Price above VWAP','Relative volume ≥ 1.8x','Index trend aligned','Spread below 0.10%','Risk capacity available'].map(x=>`<div class="rule"><span>${x}</span><span class="status pass">PASS</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="approval-actions" style="margin-top:24px"><button class="btn primary" data-action="approve">${state.auto?'Execute automatically':'Approve next step'}</button><button class="btn">Reject signal</button></div></div></div>`;
if(s==='approval')return `<div class="card signal-card"><div class="split"><div><h2>Review RELIANCE intraday</h2><p class="intro">NSE cash · LONG · CNC? MIS · Validity DAY</p></div><span class="pill ${state.auto?'green':'blue'}">${state.auto?'AUTO EXECUTION':'ASSISTED MODE'}</span></div><div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:15px"><div><h3>Order details</h3><div class="kv">${[['Order type','Market'],['Quantity','50'],['Entry price','INR 2,491.00'],['Product','MIS']].map(x=>`<div><div class="detail-label">${x[0]}</div><div class="detail-value">${x[1]}</div></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div><h3>Protection</h3><div class="kv">${[['Stop loss','INR 2,472.50'],['Target','INR 2,528.00'],['Maximum loss','INR 1,240'],['Risk/reward','1 : 2']].map(x=>`<div><div class="detail-label">${x[0]}</div><div class="detail-value">${x[1]}</div></div>`).join('')}</div></div></div><div class="rule-list" style="margin-top:24px"><div class="rule"><span>Funds available</span><span class="status pass">PASS</span></div><div class="rule"><span>Risk approved</span><span class="status pass">PASS</span></div><div class="rule"><span>Feed current</span><span class="status pass">PASS</span></div></div><div class="approval-actions" style="margin-top:24px"><button class="btn primary" data-action="approve">${state.auto?'Submit order automatically':'Approve and place order'}</button><button class="btn">Reject</button></div></div>`;
if(s==='orders')return `${shellCards()}<div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><h2>Positions</h2>${positionsTable()}</div><div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><h2>Order activity</h2><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Symbol</th><th>Side</th><th>Status</th><th>Price</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['10:42:18','RELIANCE','BUY','FILLED','2,491.00','Protected'],['10:41:15','SBIN','SELL','REJECTED','862.70','Risk limit'],['10:38:42','RELIANCE','BUY','ACKNOWLEDGED','2,490.80','Pending protection']].map(r=>`<tr>${r.map((x,i)=>`<td class="${i===3&&x==='FILLED'?'positive':''}">${x}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`;
if(s==='strategies')return `<div class="grid cols-2"><div class="card"><div class="split"><div><h2>Strategy versions</h2><p class="intro">Only tested versions can be activated</p></div><button class="btn primary">Create version</button></div>${[['ORB Cash v1.4','ACTIVE'],['ORB Cash v1.3','ARCHIVED'],['ORB Retest v0.8','DRAFT']].map(x=>`<div class="rule" style="padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span><b>${x[0]}</b><br><small class="detail-label">Versioned immutable rules</small></span><span class="status ${x[1]==='ACTIVE'?'pass':x[1]==='DRAFT'?'review':''}">${x[1]}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="card"><h2>ORB Cash v1.4</h2><p class="intro">Opening-range breakout configuration</p><div class="form-grid">${[['Universe','Nifty 200'],['Opening range','09:15 to 09:30'],['Confirmation','5-minute close'],['Entry window','09:30 to 14:45'],['Stop loss','Technical invalidation'],['Profit handling','50% at 1R, target 2R']].map(x=>`<div class="field"><label>${x[0]}</label><input value="${x[1]}" /></div>`).join('')}</div><button class="btn primary full" style="margin-top:20px">Save as new version</button></div></div>`;
if(s==='backtest')return `<div class="card"><div class="split"><div><h2>Backtest controls</h2><p class="intro">Realistic charges, spread and slippage included</p></div><button class="btn primary" data-action="backtest">Run backtest</button></div><div class="form-grid">${[['Period','01 Sep 2026 - 29 Oct 2026'],['Capital','INR 5,00,000'],['Slippage','0.05%'],['Strategy','ORB Cash v1.4']].map(x=>`<div class="field"><label>${x[0]}</label><input value="${x[1]}" /></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="grid cols-4" style="margin-top:28px">${metric('Net return','12.8%','After costs','positive')}${metric('Max drawdown','-6.4%','Peak to trough','negative')}${metric('Profit factor','1.34','Across 486 trades')}${metric('Win rate','46.7%','Out-of-sample')}</div><div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="card"><h2>Equity curve</h2><p class="intro">Cumulative result after brokerage, taxes and slippage</p>${chart()}</div><div class="card"><h2>Validation</h2><p class="intro">Release gate results</p><div class="rule-list">${[['No look-ahead bias','PASS'],['Out-of-sample stability','PASS'],['Walk-forward stability','REVIEW'],['Slippage sensitivity','PASS'],['Worst month','-3.1%'],['Monte Carlo VaR','6.7%']].map(x=>`<div class="rule"><span>${x[0]}</span><span class="status ${x[1]==='PASS'?'pass':x[1]==='REVIEW'?'review':''}">${x[1]}</span></div>`).join('')}</div></div></div>`;
if(s==='risk')return `${shellCards()}<div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="card"><h2>Risk policy</h2><p class="intro">Server-enforced limits cannot be bypassed by the browser</p><div class="form-grid">${[['Risk per trade','0.25%'],['Maximum daily loss','1.00%'],['Maximum losing trades','3'],['Concurrent positions','3'],['Exposure per symbol','20%'],['Maximum stop distance','0.80%'],['New-entry cutoff','14:45'],['Mandatory square-off','15:15']].map(x=>`<div class="field"><label>${x[0]}</label><input value="${x[1]}" /></div>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="card"><h2>Emergency controls</h2><p class="intro">Actions are audited and preserve position protection</p><div class="stack"><div class="notice"><b>Pause new entries</b><br>Existing protection remains active.</div><button class="btn full">Pause new entries</button><div class="notice"><b>Cancel and exit all</b><br>Cancel pending entries, submit controlled exits and reconcile.</div><button class="btn danger full" data-action="flatten">Cancel pending and exit all</button></div></div></div>`;
if(s==='connections')return `<div class="grid cols-2"><div class="card"><h2>Upstox</h2><p class="intro">Connection status and account mapping</p><div class="rule-list"><div class="rule"><span>Connection</span><span class="status pass">CONNECTED</span></div><div class="rule"><span>Trading account</span><b>UPX-42••</b></div><div class="rule"><span>Access token</span><span class="status pass">VALID</span></div></div><button class="btn" style="margin-top:20px">Reconnect</button></div><div class="card"><h2>Groww</h2><p class="intro">Daily authorization required; token is kept only in backend memory</p><div class="field"><label for="groww-token">Groww access token</label><input id="groww-token" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Paste today’s token" /></div><div class="rule-list" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="rule"><span>Connection</span><span class="status ${liveData.groww?.state==='VERIFIED'?'pass':liveData.groww?.state==='TOKEN_RECEIVED'?'review':'fail'}">${liveData.groww?.state||'NOT CONNECTED'}</span></div><div class="rule"><span>Verification</span><span class="detail-label">${liveData.groww?.message||'Read-only check not run'}</span></div><div class="rule"><span>API subscription</span><span class="status pass">REQUIRED</span></div></div><div class="approval-actions" style="margin-top:20px"><button class="btn primary" data-action="groww-authorize">Authorize & verify</button><button class="btn" data-action="groww-verify">Verify again</button></div></div></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><h2>Integration health</h2>${['Order updates','Positions','Market data','Order API'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="service-row"><span>${x}</span><span class="status ${liveData.groww?.state==='VERIFIED'?'pass':'review'}">${liveData.groww?.state==='VERIFIED'?'READY':'WAITING'}</span><span class="latency">${12+i*7} ms</span></div>`).join('')}</div>`;
if(s==='journal')return `<div class="grid cols-4">${metric('Net P&L','+INR 18,740','All costs','positive')}${metric('Win rate','48.6%','Last 30 sessions')}${metric('Average R','1.54R','Per closed trade')}${metric('Max drawdown','-0.72R','Current period','negative')}</div><div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="card"><h2>Performance by day</h2><p class="intro">Realized P&L after all costs</p><div class="bars">${[80,55,105,40,75,125,32,98,57,135,26,90].map((v,i)=>`<span class="bar ${i%5===2?'red':''}" style="height:${v}px"></span>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="card"><h2>Recent trades</h2><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Side</th><th>R</th><th>Outcome</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['RELIANCE','LONG','+1.8R','WIN'],['SBIN','LONG','-1.0R','LOSS'],['LT','SHORT','+1.4R','WIN'],['ICICIBANK','LONG','-1.0R','LOSS'],['TATAMOTORS','LONG','+2.0R','WIN']].map(r=>`<tr><td>${r[0]}</td><td>${r[1]}</td><td class="${r[2][0]=='+'?'positive':'negative'}">${r[2]}</td><td>${r[3]}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></div>`;
if(s==='alerts')return `<div class="grid cols-2"><div class="card"><h2>Notification rules</h2><p class="intro">Choose which events require operator action</p>${[['Order rejected','Critical'],['Position unprotected','Critical'],['Broker disconnected','Critical'],['Daily loss 80%','Warning'],['New signal','Information'],['Token approval required','Warning']].map(x=>`<div class="rule" style="padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span>${x[0]}</span><span class="status ${x[1]==='Critical'?'fail':x[1]==='Warning'?'review':'pass'}">${x[1]}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="card"><h2>Alert centre</h2><p class="intro">Recent events requiring attention</p>${[['10:42','SBIN order rejected','Risk limit','Closed'],['10:40','Position unprotected','Protection confirmed','Closed'],['10:37','Market feed recovered','Freshness restored','Resolved']].map(x=>`<div class="rule" style="padding:15px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)"><span><b>${x[0]}</b> ${x[1]}<br><small class="detail-label">${x[2]}</small></span><span class="status pass">${x[3]}</span></div>`).join('')}</div></div>`;
return `<div class="grid cols-4">${metric('Overall state','HEALTHY','No blocking incidents','positive')}${metric('Market-data age','86 ms','Below 2 s limit')}${metric('Broker sync','5 s','Positions matched')}${metric('Order rate','0.8 / s','Below configured cap')}</div><div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="card"><h2>Service health</h2><p class="intro">Automatic trading pauses when a critical dependency fails</p>${['API server','Strategy engine','Risk engine','Market-data stream','Order manager','PostgreSQL','Redis event bus'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="service-row"><span>${x}</span><span class="status healthy">HEALTHY</span><span class="latency">${[34,18,12,86,112,8,4][i]} ms</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="card"><h2>Audit events</h2><p class="intro">Immutable chronological decision trail</p><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Event</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['10:42:18','Tick batch processed','86 instruments'],['10:42:15','Position reconciliation','Matched'],['10:41:15','Order rejected','Risk limit'],['10:41:14','Risk decision','Rejected'],['10:41:13','Signal generated','SBIN long'],['10:40:00','Candle closed','5-minute']].map(r=>`<tr><td><b>${r[0]}</b></td><td>${r[1]}</td><td>${r[2]}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></div>`}
function candidateTable(n){return `<table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Sector</th><th>Price</th><th>OR high</th><th>Distance</th><th>Rel. vol.</th><th>VWAP</th><th>State</th></tr></thead><tbody>${candidates.slice(0,n).map(r=>`<tr><td><b>${r[0]}</b></td><td>${r[1]}</td><td>${r[2]}</td><td>${r[3]}</td><td>${r[4]}</td><td>${r[5]}</td><td>${r[6]}</td><td><span class="status ${r[7]==='REJECT'?'fail':r[7]==='READY'?'pass':'review'}">${r[7]}</span></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>`}
function positionsTable(){return `<table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Side</th><th>Qty</th><th>Avg price</th><th>LTP</th><th>Stop</th><th>Target</th><th>P&L</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>RELIANCE</b></td><td>LONG</td><td>50</td><td>2,491.00</td><td>2,503.00</td><td>2,472.50</td><td>2,528.00</td><td class="positive">+INR 600</td></tr><tr><td><b>NIFTY</b></td><td>SHORT</td><td>25</td><td>19,480.20</td><td>19,460.00</td><td>19,520.00</td><td>19,390.00</td><td class="positive">+INR 505</td></tr></tbody></table>`}
function bind(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-screen]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.screen=b.dataset.screen;state.toast='';app()});document.querySelector('#auto-toggle')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{state.auto=e.target.checked;state.toast=state.auto?'Auto mode enabled: eligible signals will execute after risk approval.':'Paper/assisted mode restored: approval is required before broker submission.';app()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-action="approve"]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.toast=state.auto?'Order submitted automatically after server-side risk approval.':'Approval recorded. Order is ready for broker submission.';app()});document.querySelector('[data-action="enable-session"]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.toast=`${state.auto?'Auto':'Paper'} session enabled after readiness checks.`;app()});document.querySelector('[data-action="flatten"]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.toast='Emergency action staged: pending entries cancelled and exits queued for reconciliation.';app()});document.querySelector('[data-action="backtest"]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.toast='Backtest complete. Validation results refreshed.';app()})}
async function apiPost(path,payload){const response=await fetch(path,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(payload)});const data=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(data.error||'API request failed');return data}
async function hydrate(){try{const [summaryResponse,readinessResponse,configResponse,growwResponse]=await Promise.all([fetch('/api/summary?symbol=NIFTY50'),fetch('/api/readiness?symbol=NIFTY50'),fetch('/api/session/config'),fetch('/api/brokers/groww')]);if(summaryResponse.ok)liveData=await summaryResponse.json();if(readinessResponse.ok)liveData.readiness=await readinessResponse.json();if(configResponse.ok)liveData.session_config=await configResponse.json();if(growwResponse.ok)liveData.groww=await growwResponse.json();app()}catch(error){console.warn('Local API unavailable; showing UI fallback data',error)}}
async function runBacktest(){try{state.toast='Running SQLite backtest...';app();await apiPost('/api/backtest',{symbol:'NIFTY50',mode:state.auto?'auto':'assisted',equity:500000});await hydrate();state.toast='SQLite backtest complete. Dashboard refreshed.';app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Backtest failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
async function enableSession(){try{const values={account_balance:Number(document.querySelector('#account-balance')?.value),trading_capital:Number(document.querySelector('#trading-capital')?.value),risk_per_trade_pct:Number(document.querySelector('#risk-per-trade')?.value),daily_loss_pct:Number(document.querySelector('#daily-loss')?.value)};state.toast='Saving server-enforced capital and risk setup...';app();await apiPost('/api/session/config',values);const result=await apiPost('/api/session/run',{symbol:'NIFTY50',mode:state.auto?'auto':'paper',date:liveData.premarket?.context_date});await hydrate();state.toast=`Session ${result.date} started with INR ${values.trading_capital.toLocaleString('en-IN')} allocated capital.`;app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Session setup failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
async function approveLatest(){try{const result=await apiPost('/api/orders/approve',{});state.toast=`Order ${result.client_ref} approved in SQLite.`;await hydrate();app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Approval failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
async function killSwitch(){try{const result=await apiPost('/api/kill-switch',{});state.toast=`Kill switch active. ${result.cancelled_orders.length} pending orders cancelled.`;await hydrate();app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Kill switch failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
async function verifyGroww(){try{state.toast='Checking Groww token with a read-only market-data request...';app();const result=await apiPost('/api/brokers/groww/verify',{});liveData.groww=result;state.toast=`Groww verified: ${result.message}.`;app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Groww verification failed: ${error.message}`;await hydrate()}}
async function authorizeGroww(){const field=document.querySelector('#groww-token');const token=field?.value.trim();if(!token){state.toast='Enter today’s Groww access token first.';app();return}try{const result=await apiPost('/api/brokers/groww/configure',{access_token:token});if(field)field.value='';liveData.groww=result;app();await verifyGroww()}catch(error){state.toast=`Groww authorization failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
function updateRiskPreview(){const balance=Number(document.querySelector('#account-balance')?.value||0);const capital=Number(document.querySelector('#trading-capital')?.value||0);const risk=Number(document.querySelector('#risk-per-trade')?.value||0);const loss=Number(document.querySelector('#daily-loss')?.value||0);const utilization=balance>0?Math.max(0,Math.min(100,capital/balance*100)):0;const money=value=>`INR ${Math.max(0,value).toLocaleString('en-IN',{maximumFractionDigits:0})}`;const label=document.querySelector('#utilization-label');const bar=document.querySelector('#utilization-bar');const riskAmount=document.querySelector('#risk-amount');const lossAmount=document.querySelector('#loss-amount');const unused=document.querySelector('#unused-amount');if(label)label.textContent=`${utilization.toFixed(1)}%`;if(bar){bar.style.width=`${utilization}%`;bar.classList.toggle('danger',capital>balance)}if(riskAmount)riskAmount.textContent=money(capital*risk/100);if(lossAmount)lossAmount.textContent=money(capital*loss/100);if(unused)unused.textContent=money(balance-capital)}
function bindSetupInteractions(){['account-balance','trading-capital','risk-per-trade','daily-loss'].forEach(id=>document.querySelector(`#${id}`)?.addEventListener('input',updateRiskPreview));document.querySelectorAll('[data-preset]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const balance=Number(document.querySelector('#account-balance')?.value||0);const capital=document.querySelector('#trading-capital');if(capital)capital.value=(balance*Number(button.dataset.preset)/100).toFixed(0);updateRiskPreview()}));updateRiskPreview()}
function bind(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-screen]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.screen=b.dataset.screen;state.toast='';app()});document.querySelector('#auto-toggle')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{state.auto=e.target.checked;state.toast=state.auto?'Auto mode enabled: eligible signals will execute after risk approval.':'Paper/assisted mode restored: approval is required before broker submission.';app()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-action="approve"]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(state.auto){state.toast='Auto mode submits after risk approval; no manual approval is required.';app()}else approveLatest()});document.querySelector('[data-action="enable-session"]')?.addEventListener('click',enableSession);document.querySelector('[data-action="flatten"]')?.addEventListener('click',killSwitch);document.querySelector('[data-action="backtest"]')?.addEventListener('click',runBacktest);document.querySelector('[data-action="groww-authorize"]')?.addEventListener('click',authorizeGroww);document.querySelector('[data-action="groww-verify"]')?.addEventListener('click',verifyGroww);bindSetupInteractions()}
function liveScannerScreen(){const m=liveData.market||{};const quotes=m.quotes||[];const rows=quotes.length?quotes.map(q=>`<tr><td><b>${q.trading_symbol}</b></td><td>${q.exchange}</td><td>INR ${Number(q.last_price).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</td><td>${formatIndiaTime(q.received_at)}</td><td><span class="status pass">LIVE QUOTE</span></td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">No live quotes stored yet. Verify Groww, then poll market data.</td></tr>`;return `<div class="card"><div class="split"><div><div class="eyebrow">REAL DATA PIPELINE</div><h2>Live market scanner</h2><p class="intro">Groww quotes are polled automatically every 60 seconds while this page is open.</p></div><button class="btn primary" data-action="poll-market">Poll now</button></div><div class="notice" style="margin-bottom:20px">${m.message||'Auto polling will start when this page is open and the token is verified.'}</div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Exchange</th><th>Last price</th><th>Received (India)</th><th>State</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows}</tbody></table><div class="split" style="margin-top:20px"><span class="status review">${m.signals_ready?'SIGNALS AVAILABLE':'SIGNALS NOT READY'}</span><span class="detail-label">${m.signals_ready?'Open Signal analysis for details.':'Next: accumulate live 5-minute candles'}</span></div></div>`}
async function pollMarket(){try{state.toast='Polling Groww read-only quotes...';app();const result=await apiPost('/api/live-data/poll',{});liveData.market=result;liveData.liveEvaluation=await apiPost('/api/live-data/evaluate',{});liveData.market.signals_ready=liveData.liveEvaluation.signals_ready;state.toast=`${result.updated} live Groww quotes stored; paper strategy evaluated.`;app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Live data poll failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
function liveEvaluationPanel(){const e=liveData.liveEvaluation;if(!e)return '';const rows=(e.evaluations||[]).map(item=>{const signal=item.signals?.[0];return `<tr><td><b>${item.symbol}</b></td><td>${item.completed_5m_candles||0}</td><td><span class="status ${item.status==='EVALUATED'?'pass':'review'}">${item.status}</span></td><td>${signal?`${signal.direction} · ${signal.status} · ${signal.reason}`:item.message||'No breakout signal'}</td></tr>`}).join('');return `<div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><h2>Live paper strategy evaluation</h2><p class="intro">Only Groww-derived completed candles are evaluated. No broker orders are submitted.</p><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>5m candles</th><th>State</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows||'<tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">No live symbols have been polled yet.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div>`}
function liveSignalScreen(){const items=(liveData.liveEvaluation?.evaluations||[]).flatMap(item=>(item.signals||[]).map(signal=>({...signal,symbol:item.symbol})));if(!items.length)return `<div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">LIVE SIGNAL ANALYSIS</div><h2>No live signal yet</h2><p class="intro">The app is receiving Groww quotes, but no completed live 5-minute candle has qualified for a breakout.</p><div class="notice">Continue automatic polling from the Scanner page. When a real signal appears, this page will show its direction, entry, VWAP, relative volume, status, and rejection reason.</div></div>`;const signal=items[0];return `<div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">LIVE SIGNAL ANALYSIS</div><h2>${signal.symbol} · ${signal.direction}</h2><p class="intro">Generated from Groww-derived completed 5-minute data.</p><div class="grid cols-4">${metric('Status',signal.status,signal.reason)}${metric('Entry',`INR ${Number(signal.entry_price).toLocaleString('en-IN')}`,formatIndiaTime(signal.candle_ts))}${metric('VWAP',`INR ${Number(signal.vwap).toLocaleString('en-IN')}`,'Live session')}${metric('Relative volume',`${Number(signal.relative_volume).toFixed(2)}x`,'Strategy threshold')}</div></div>`}
function premarketPanel(){const p=liveData.premarket||{};const select=(id,label,values)=>`<div class="field"><label for="premarket-${id}">${label}</label><select id="premarket-${id}">${values.map(v=>`<option value="${v}" ${p[id]===v?'selected':''}>${v}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>`;return `<div class="card premarket-card"><div class="split"><div><div class="eyebrow">DAILY REFRESH · ${p.context_date||'TODAY'}</div><h2>Pre-market context</h2><p class="intro">Separate market-context model. It does not change ORB rules; it decides whether today is safe to evaluate.</p></div><span class="status ${p.status==='READY'?'pass':p.status==='NO-TRADE'?'fail':'review'}">${p.status||'INCOMPLETE'}</span></div><div class="grid cols-2 premarket-grid">${select('market_regime','Market regime',['UNKNOWN','TRENDING','RANGE','MIXED'])}${select('index_bias','Index bias',['UNKNOWN','BULLISH','BEARISH','NEUTRAL'])}${select('volatility','Volatility',['UNKNOWN','LOW','NORMAL','HIGH'])}${select('event_risk','Event/news risk',['UNKNOWN','LOW','MEDIUM','HIGH'])}${select('liquidity','Liquidity',['UNKNOWN','GOOD','THIN'])}<div class="field"><label for="premarket-notes">Readable notes</label><input id="premarket-notes" value="${p.notes||''}" placeholder="Example: RBI event at 12:00; avoid new entries" /></div></div><div class="premarket-checks"><label><input id="premarket-data" type="checkbox" ${p.broker_data_ready?'checked':''}> Groww connection and market data checked</label><label><input id="premarket-news" type="checkbox" ${p.news_reviewed?'checked':''}> News/events reviewed for today</label><label><input id="premarket-no-trade" type="checkbox" ${p.no_trade?'checked':''}> Activate no-trade gate</label></div><div class="split premarket-actions"><span class="notice">${p.message||'Complete the checklist before starting today’s session.'}</span><button class="btn primary" data-action="save-premarket">Save today’s context</button></div></div>`}
const originalLiveScanner=liveScannerScreen;liveScannerScreen=function(){return originalLiveScanner()+liveEvaluationPanel()};
const legacyScreen=screen;screen=function(s){if(s==='scanner'||s==='quotes')return liveScannerScreen();if(s==='signal')return liveSignalScreen();return legacyScreen(s)};
const legacyBind=bind;bind=function(){legacyBind();document.querySelector('[data-action="poll-market"]')?.addEventListener('click',pollMarket);if(scannerTimer)clearInterval(scannerTimer);scannerTimer=null};
premarketPanel=function(){const p=liveData.premarket||{};const row=(label,value)=>`<div class="rule"><span>${label}</span><b>${value||'UNKNOWN'}</b></div>`;return `<div class="card premarket-card"><div class="split"><div><div class="eyebrow">AUTOMATIC DAILY REFRESH · ${p.context_date||'TODAY'}</div><h2>Pre-market context model</h2><p class="intro">Generated from Groww quote observations. No manual market selection is required.</p></div><span class="status ${p.status==='READY'?'pass':p.status==='NO-TRADE'?'fail':'review'}">${p.status||'NOT REFRESHED'}</span></div><div class="premarket-results">${row('Market regime',p.market_regime)}${row('Index bias',p.index_bias)}${row('Volatility',p.volatility)}${row('Liquidity',p.liquidity)}${row('Event/news risk',p.news_source==='NOT_CONNECTED'?'NEWS SOURCE NOT CONNECTED':(p.event_risk||'UNKNOWN'))}</div><div class="premarket-checks"><span>Groww data: ${p.broker_data_ready?'READY':'WAITING'}</span><span>News data: ${p.news_source==='NOT_CONNECTED'?'NOT CONNECTED':'READY'}</span></div><div class="split premarket-actions"><span class="notice">${p.message||'Click refresh to generate today’s automatic analysis.'}</span><button class="btn primary" data-action="refresh-premarket">Refresh automatic analysis</button></div><p class="detail-label" style="margin-top:12px">${p.notes||'The model will not invent a news decision. Trading remains blocked until required data is available.'}</p></div>`};
const screenWithPremarket=screen;screen=function(s){if(s==='session')return premarketPanel()+screenWithPremarket(s);return screenWithPremarket(s)};
async function savePremarket(){try{const payload={context_date:liveData.premarket?.context_date,market_regime:document.querySelector('#premarket-market_regime')?.value,index_bias:document.querySelector('#premarket-index_bias')?.value,volatility:document.querySelector('#premarket-volatility')?.value,event_risk:document.querySelector('#premarket-event_risk')?.value,liquidity:document.querySelector('#premarket-liquidity')?.value,notes:document.querySelector('#premarket-notes')?.value,broker_data_ready:document.querySelector('#premarket-data')?.checked,news_reviewed:document.querySelector('#premarket-news')?.checked,no_trade:document.querySelector('#premarket-no-trade')?.checked};state.toast='Saving today’s pre-market context...';app();liveData.premarket=await apiPost('/api/premarket',payload);state.toast=liveData.premarket.ready?'Pre-market context saved. Session gate is ready.':'Saved, but today remains blocked until all required checks pass.';app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Pre-market save failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
const bindWithPremarket=bind;bind=function(){bindWithPremarket();document.querySelector('[data-action="save-premarket"]')?.addEventListener('click',savePremarket)};
async function refreshPremarket(){try{state.toast='Refreshing automatic pre-market analysis from Groww...';app();liveData.premarket=await apiPost('/api/premarket/refresh',{});state.toast=`Automatic analysis refreshed: ${liveData.premarket.status}.`;app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Automatic pre-market refresh failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
const bindWithAutoPremarket=bind;bind=function(){bindWithAutoPremarket();document.querySelector('[data-action="refresh-premarket"]')?.addEventListener('click',refreshPremarket)};
const hydrateWithPremarket=hydrate;hydrate=async function(){await hydrateWithPremarket();try{const response=await fetch('/api/premarket');if(response.ok)liveData.premarket=await response.json();app()}catch(error){console.warn('Pre-market context unavailable',error)}};
const baseApp=app;app=function(){baseApp();const labels={command:'Dashboard',scanner:'Market Scanner',quotes:'Live Quotes',strategies:'Strategy',backtest:'Paper Replay',risk:'Risk Management',journal:'Journal',connections:'Connections',session:'Daily session',signal:'Signal Analysis',approval:'Trade Approval',orders:'Positions & Orders',alerts:'Alerts',health:'System Health'};const icons={command:'▦',scanner:'⌕',quotes:'▥',strategies:'▱',backtest:'▶',risk:'⬟',journal:'▤',connections:'⚙',session:'◷',signal:'⌁',approval:'✓',orders:'▤',alerts:'!',health:'◉'};document.querySelectorAll('.nav button').forEach(btn=>{const id=btn.dataset.screen;if(labels[id])btn.textContent=`${icons[id]||'•'}  ${labels[id]}`});const badges=document.querySelector('.badges');if(badges&&!document.querySelector('.header-context'))badges.insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin',`<div class="header-context"><span class="header-time">${new Date().toLocaleString('en-IN',{weekday:'short',day:'2-digit',month:'short',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',second:'2-digit',hour12:false})}</span><span class="header-market"><i></i> Market Open</span><span class="header-sim">Live (Simulated)</span></div>`)};
let premarketAutoRefreshStarted=false;const renderedApp=app;app=function(){renderedApp();if(state.screen==='session'&&!premarketAutoRefreshStarted&&liveData.groww?.state==='VERIFIED'&&!liveData.premarket?.fresh){premarketAutoRefreshStarted=true;refreshPremarket()}};
const appWithAuthBanner=app;app=function(){appWithAuthBanner();if(liveData.groww?.state==='EXPIRED'){const topbar=document.querySelector('.topbar');if(topbar&&!document.querySelector('.auth-expired-banner'))topbar.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',`<div class="auth-expired-banner"><b>Groww token expired or was rejected.</b> Update today’s token in <span data-screen="connections">Connections</span> before starting or polling the trading session.</div>`);document.querySelector('.auth-expired-banner [data-screen="connections"]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.screen='connections';app()})}};
positionsTable=function(){const rows=liveData.paper_positions||[];if(!rows.length)return `<div class="empty">No active SQLite paper positions. Real Groww positions are shown only after reconciliation.</div>`;return `<table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Side</th><th>Qty</th><th>Requested</th><th>Current LTP</th><th>Status</th><th>Reason</th><th>Actions</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(row=>`<tr><td><b>${row.symbol}</b></td><td>${row.side||row.direction}</td><td>${row.quantity}</td><td>INR ${Number(row.requested_price).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</td><td>INR ${Number(row.ltp).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</td><td><span class="status review">${row.status}</span></td><td>${row.reason||'—'}</td><td>${row.status==='PENDING_APPROVAL'?`<button class="btn primary compact" title="Approve this paper position" data-action="approve-order" data-order-id="${row.id}">✓</button> <button class="btn danger compact" title="Reject this paper position" data-action="reject-order" data-order-id="${row.id}">✕</button>`:'—'}</td><td>PAPER · SQLite</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>`};
shellCards=function(){const pnl=Number(liveData.net_pnl||0);const positions=(liveData.paper_positions||[]).length;return `<div class="grid cols-4">${metric('SQLite paper P&L',`${pnl>=0?'+':''}INR ${pnl.toLocaleString('en-IN')}`,`${liveData.trades||0} closed paper trades`,pnl>=0?'positive':'negative')}${metric('Paper win rate',`${liveData.win_rate_pct||0}%`,`${liveData.wins||0} wins / ${liveData.losses||0} losses`)}${metric('Paper positions',positions,positions?'SQLite order intents':'No active paper exposure')}${metric('Groww data',liveData.groww?.state==='VERIFIED'?'VERIFIED':'NOT VERIFIED','Read-only market data',liveData.groww?.state==='VERIFIED'?'positive':'negative')}</div>`};
function realDashboardScreen(){const quotes=liveData.market?.quotes||[];const signalRows=(liveData.signals||[]).slice(0,8);const quoteBody=quotes.length?quotes.map(q=>`<tr><td><b>${q.trading_symbol}</b></td><td>INR ${Number(q.last_price).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</td><td>${formatIndiaTime(q.received_at)}</td><td><span class="status pass">GROWW LTP</span></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">No live quote snapshot yet. Verify Groww and open Live Quotes.</td></tr>';const signalBody=signalRows.length?signalRows.map(s=>`<tr><td><b>${s.symbol}</b></td><td>${s.direction}</td><td>${s.status}</td><td>${s.reason}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">No SQLite signals recorded yet.</td></tr>';return `${shellCards()}<div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="card"><div class="split"><div><h2>Live Groww quote snapshot</h2><p class="intro">Read-only broker data received by the local API.</p></div><button class="btn primary" data-screen="quotes">Open Live Quotes</button></div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Last price</th><th>Received (India)</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody>${quoteBody}</tbody></table></div><div class="card"><div class="split"><div><h2>SQLite strategy signals</h2><p class="intro">Signals generated by the implemented ORB rules.</p></div><button class="btn" data-screen="signal">Signal analysis</button></div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Direction</th><th>Status</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody>${signalBody}</tbody></table></div></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="split"><div><h2>Paper positions</h2><p class="intro">SQLite paper order intents only; not live broker holdings.</p></div><span class="status review">PAPER DATA</span></div>${positionsTable()}</div>`}
function realOrdersScreen(){const orders=liveData.paper_orders||[];const body=orders.length?orders.map(o=>`<tr><td>${formatIndiaTime(o.created_at)}</td><td><b>${o.symbol}</b></td><td>${o.side}</td><td>${o.quantity}</td><td>${o.status}</td><td>PAPER · SQLite</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="6" class="empty">No SQLite paper order intents recorded.</td></tr>';return `${shellCards()}<div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="split"><div><h2>Paper positions</h2><p class="intro">No live broker positions are implied by this table.</p></div><span class="status review">PAPER DATA</span></div>${positionsTable()}</div><div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><h2>SQLite paper order activity</h2><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Created (India)</th><th>Symbol</th><th>Side</th><th>Qty</th><th>Status</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody>${body}</tbody></table></div>`}
const screenWithRealData=screen;screen=function(s){if(s==='command')return realDashboardScreen();if(s==='orders')return realOrdersScreen();return screenWithRealData(s)};
realOrdersScreen=function(){const orders=liveData.paper_orders||[];const body=orders.length?orders.map(o=>`<tr><td>${formatIndiaTime(o.created_at)}</td><td><b>${o.symbol}</b></td><td>${o.side}</td><td>${o.quantity}</td><td>${o.status}</td><td>PAPER · SQLite</td><td>${o.status==='PENDING_APPROVAL'?`<button class="btn primary compact" title="Approve this paper order" data-action="approve-order" data-order-id="${o.id}">✓ Approve</button> <button class="btn danger compact" title="Reject this paper order" data-action="reject-order" data-order-id="${o.id}">✕ Reject</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="7" class="empty">No SQLite paper order intents recorded.</td></tr>';const bulk=`<div class="approval-actions"><button class="btn primary" title="Approve all pending paper orders" data-action="approve-all-orders">✓ Approve all</button><button class="btn danger" title="Reject all pending paper orders" data-action="reject-all-orders">✕ Reject all</button></div>`;return `${shellCards()}<div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="split"><div><h2>Paper positions</h2><p class="intro">No live broker positions are implied by this table.</p></div><span class="status review">PAPER DATA</span></div>${positionsTable()}</div><div class="card" style="margin-top:28px"><div class="split"><div><h2>SQLite paper order activity</h2><p class="intro">Each pending row has individual actions; bulk actions are also available.</p></div>${bulk}</div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Created (India)</th><th>Symbol</th><th>Side</th><th>Qty</th><th>Status</th><th>Source</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody>${body}</tbody></table></div>`};
async function approvePaperOrder(orderId){try{await apiPost('/api/orders/approve',{order_id:Number(orderId)});state.toast='Paper order approved in SQLite.';await hydrate();app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Approval failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
async function rejectPaperOrder(orderId){try{await apiPost('/api/orders/reject',{order_id:Number(orderId)});state.toast='Paper order rejected and cancelled in SQLite.';await hydrate();app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Rejection failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
async function bulkPaperOrderAction(action){try{const result=await apiPost(`/api/orders/${action}-all`,{});state.toast=`${result.count} paper orders ${action==='approve'?'approved':'rejected'}.`;await hydrate();app()}catch(error){state.toast=`Bulk ${action} failed: ${error.message}`;app()}}
const bindWithOrderActions=bind;bind=function(){bindWithOrderActions();document.querySelectorAll('[data-action="approve-order"]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>approvePaperOrder(button.dataset.orderId)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-action="reject-order"]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>rejectPaperOrder(button.dataset.orderId)));document.querySelector('[data-action="approve-all-orders"]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>bulkPaperOrderAction('approve'));document.querySelector('[data-action="reject-all-orders"]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>bulkPaperOrderAction('reject'))};
const bindWithModePersistence=bind;bind=function(){bindWithModePersistence();document.querySelector('#auto-toggle')?.addEventListener('change',event=>{try{localStorage.setItem('breakout.autoMode',event.target.checked?'true':'false')}catch(error){}})};
const hydrateWithLiveData=hydrate;hydrate=async function(){await hydrateWithLiveData();try{const response=await fetch('/api/live-data/status');if(response.ok){const data=await response.json();liveData.market={...(liveData.market||{}),...data,quotes:data.quotes||[]}}app()}catch(error){console.warn('Live data snapshot unavailable',error)}};
app();
hydrate();
